<title>UK: Exceler has 68.4 pct of Ashbourne.</title>
<headline>Exceler has 68.4 pct of Ashbourne.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Exceler Health Care Group Plc, a unit of U.S. healthcare group Sun Health Care, said on Tuesday it received acceptances for 36,703,862 issued ordinary shares in Ashbourne Plc, representing 68.4 percent of the latter's capital.</p>
<p>Exceler said the total included 1,413,129 shares for which Exceler held irrevocable acceptances. It said it was extending its offer until January 27.</p>
<p>Exceler said Sun Group already owned 29.2 percent of Ashbourne and now has a total 97.6 percent of the British group.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
